---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Hot Tub Launch — One Store Per Market" description="One hot tub store per market, by application. We find every leak in your online presence, seal it, then pour fuel — so the buyers you've already earned stop slipping away." pageClass="" ogUrl="https://hottublaunch.com" ogImage="https://hottublaunch.com/og-preview.jpg?v=2">

<!-- Zero-size scroll sentinels. These let the nav state and the concierge widget
     react to scroll position through IntersectionObserver, so the scroll handler
     never has to read window.scrollY (a forced layout) on a normal frame. -->
<div class="sentinel" id="topSentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="sentinel" id="heroSentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div class="stickyhead" id="stickyHead">
  <!-- ANNOUNCEMENT BAR — swap for whichever market status is true right now -->
  <div class="annbar" role="region" aria-label="Announcement"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>By application only · One store per market · A limited number of 2026 territories remain<a href="/apply">Apply now →</a></div>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav class="topnav">
  <div class="navrow">
    <a class="logo" href="#top">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><ellipse cx="24" cy="37" rx="17" ry="3.4" stroke="#191919" stroke-width="1.6"/><ellipse cx="24" cy="37" rx="10.5" ry="2" stroke="#191919" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".6"/><circle cx="24" cy="21" r="13" stroke="#191919" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M20 34 C18 24 22 15 31 8 C27 17 27 26 28 34 Z" fill="#CE1126"/></svg>
      <span><span class="w1">Hot Tub</span><span class="w2">Launch</span></span>
    </a>
    <div class="navlinks" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#why">Why We Exist</a>
      <a href="#mechanism">The System</a>
      <a href="#leaks">The Seven Leaks</a>
      <a href="#cases">Proof</a>
      <a href="/profit-playbook/" class="newpill"><span class="newdot"></span>New: Free Playbook</a>
      <a class="navcta btn btn--primary" href="/apply" style="padding:.7em 1.3em;font-size:.72rem">Apply</a>
    </div>
    <button class="navburger" id="navBurger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navLinks">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  </nav>
</div>

<main id="main">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-spot" id="heroSpot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <span class="kicker2">Your traffic is flowing.</span>
  <h1>But your bucket has <span class="red">holes.</span></h1>
  <p class="sub">Your store is a bucket. Every buyer in your market is water being poured in — but the bucket has holes. We find every leak, seal it, then pour fuel.</p>
  <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/apply">Apply for Your Market<span class="arrow">→</span></a>

  <div class="stage">
    <div class="fcard c1">
      <span class="connect"></span>
      <span class="icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 17a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" stroke="#F0475C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 17l4.2-4.2" stroke="#F0475C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1.4" fill="#F0475C"/></svg></span>
      <div class="lab">Leak · Speed</div>
      <div class="val">21.2s <span class="arrow">→</span> <span class="win">2.4s</span></div>
      <div class="cap">Site speed to first interaction</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard c2">
      <span class="connect"></span>
      <span class="icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13 3 5 14h6l-1 7 8-11h-6l1-7z" fill="#F0475C"/></svg></span>
      <div class="lab">Leak · Follow-up</div>
      <div class="val">0 texts <span class="arrow">→</span> <span class="win">Instant</span></div>
      <div class="cap">Lead response time</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard c3">
      <span class="connect"></span>
      <span class="icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.4 8-7 9-3.6-1-7-4-7-9V6l7-3z" stroke="#F0475C" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="#F0475C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
      <div class="lab">Leak · Proof</div>
      <div class="val">3 shown <span class="arrow">→</span> <span class="win">142 live</span></div>
      <div class="cap">Live social proof on site</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard c4">
      <span class="connect"></span>
      <span class="icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" stroke="#F0475C" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.6" stroke="#F0475C" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.2" fill="#F0475C"/></svg></span>
      <div class="lab">Leak · Clarity</div>
      <div class="val">9 choices <span class="arrow">→</span> <span class="win">1 step</span></div>
      <div class="cap">Path to purchase simplified</div>
    </div>

    <div class="bucket-wrap">
      <svg class="bucket" viewBox="0 0 190 230" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <defs>
          <clipPath id="bucketClip"><path d="M40 60h110l-12 130a9 9 0 0 1-9 8H61a9 9 0 0 1-9-8L40 60z"/></clipPath>
          <linearGradient id="waterGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#F0475C" stop-opacity=".55"/>
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8a0e1c" stop-opacity=".5"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <ellipse cx="95" cy="214" rx="58" ry="10" fill="#CE1126" opacity=".16"/>
        <path d="M40 60h110l-12 130a9 9 0 0 1-9 8H61a9 9 0 0 1-9-8L40 60z" fill="rgba(250,247,242,.03)" stroke="rgba(250,247,242,.55)" stroke-width="2.4"/>
        <path d="M32 60h126" stroke="rgba(250,247,242,.7)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M55 60c0-11 16-19 40-19s40 8 40 19" stroke="rgba(250,247,242,.55)" stroke-width="2.4"/>
        <g clip-path="url(#bucketClip)">
          <rect class="water" x="35" y="148" width="120" height="86" fill="url(#waterGrad)"/>
        </g>
        <line class="pin pin1 bucket-glow" x1="70" y1="118" x2="70" y2="70" stroke="#F0475C" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <circle class="pin pin1 bucket-glow" cx="70" cy="70" r="4.5" fill="#F0475C"/>
        <line class="pin pin2 bucket-glow" x1="100" y1="140" x2="100" y2="95" stroke="#F0475C" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <circle class="pin pin2 bucket-glow" cx="100" cy="95" r="4.5" fill="#F0475C"/>
        <line class="pin pin3 bucket-glow" x1="122" y1="128" x2="122" y2="112" stroke="#F0475C" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <circle class="pin pin3 bucket-glow" cx="122" cy="112" r="4.5" fill="#F0475C"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="trust">
    <div class="tlab">Real stores, real results</div>
    <div class="tlogos-wrap">
      <div class="tlogos">
        <span>Paradise Spas — Minot, ND</span>
        <span>The Hot Tub Store — Michigan</span>
        <span>Paradise Spas — Minot, ND</span>
        <span>The Hot Tub Store — Michigan</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY WE EXIST -->
<section class="why" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal">Why we exist</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">Every store is quietly losing buyers it already earned</h2>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
      <div class="reveal d2">
        <p class="kicker">The demand is there.</p>
        <p>The buyers are online, they have the money, and they've already decided they want a hot tub. Stores don't lose them because people stopped wanting tubs.</p>
        <p>They lose them to a website that takes too long to load, a follow-up that doesn't exist, a message that sounds like every other store, and a page that offers ten choices and no reason to act.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal d3">
        <p><b>The buyers don't disappear. They just buy from someone easier.</b></p>
        <p>And the owner never sees it happen. They see a quieter week. A slower showroom. So they do the one thing that feels like progress — pour in more traffic, which only drains the bucket faster.</p>
        <p>We find every leak, we seal it, and only then do we pour fuel on it. <b>We don't run ads and hope. First, we fix <em>the holes</em>.</b></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MECHANISM -->
<section class="mech grain seam-top" id="mechanism">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow on-ink reveal">The mechanism</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">Find the leaks. Seal them.<br>Then pour fuel.</h2>
    <p class="lede reveal d2">This is the whole system as a three-act story — and the order is the pitch. It's what makes us the expert who sees what the owner can't.</p>
    <div class="acts">
      <div class="act reveal d1"><div class="n">1</div><h3>Find the leaks</h3><p>The free audit walks the entire online presence and shows, leak by leak, exactly where buyers slip away — with the real numbers behind it.</p></div>
      <div class="act reveal d2"><div class="n">2</div><h3>Seal them</h3><p>Speed, follow-up, message, clarity, proof. We make the bucket hold before a single new dollar goes in.</p></div>
      <div class="act reveal d3"><div class="n">3</div><h3>Then pour fuel</h3><p>Only once it holds do we turn on traffic — and now every dollar stays, because there's nowhere for it to leak out.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="callout reveal d4"><b>"Don't advertise yet" is a feature, not a limitation.</b> It's the thing no other agency has the nerve to say — and it's why owners trust us.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AUDIT SNAPSHOT — this is the free audit rendered as a live-feeling data card -->
<section class="snapshot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal">What the audit finds</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">This is what a leak looks like</h2>
    <p class="lede reveal d2" style="margin:1rem 0 2rem">A real audit walks all seven leaks with your actual numbers. Here's the shape of it — bars fill in as we score your store.</p>
    <div class="snap-card reveal d3 lift" id="snapCard">
      <div class="snap-chrome" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <div class="snap-head"><span class="t">Example audit shape — Online Presence Score</span><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="badge">3 of 7 leaks critical</span><span class="live"><span class="pulse"></span><span id="scanTime">Scanned just now</span></span></span></div>
      <div class="snap-rows">
        <div class="snap-row"><span class="nm">Speed</span><span class="sc">21.2s</span><div class="bar" style="--w:38%"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="snap-row"><span class="nm">Capture</span><span class="sc">No pixel</span><div class="bar" style="--w:10%"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="snap-row"><span class="nm">Message</span><span class="sc">Generic</span><div class="bar" style="--w:45%"><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="snap-row"><span class="nm">Clarity</span><span class="sc">9 choices</span><div class="bar" style="--w:30%"><i></i></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SEVEN LEAKS -->
<section class="leaks" id="leaks">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal">The seven leaks</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">The recurring themes</h2>
    <p class="lede reveal d2">These are the seven leaks the audit finds — and the seven pillars of the fix. Every store can lead with exactly one.</p>
    <div class="leaklist">
      <div class="leak reveal"><span class="icon-badge"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13 2 4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z" fill="#CE1126"/></svg></span><div><span class="leaknum">Leak 01</span><h3>Speed</h3><p>Your site makes people wait. Most visitors are on a phone, and most quit after a few seconds.</p></div></div>
      <div class="leak reveal d1"><span class="icon-badge"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="2"/></svg></span><div><span class="leaknum">Leak 02</span><h3>Capture</h3><p>Almost everyone leaves — and you can't reach a single one again. No pixel, no come-back list, no heatmap.</p></div></div>
      <div class="leak reveal d2"><span class="icon-badge"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-4 4V5z" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><div><span class="leaknum">Leak 03</span><h3>Message</h3><p>Your words sound like every other hot tub store. Cover the logo and it could belong to anyone.</p></div></div>
      <div class="leak reveal d3"><span class="icon-badge"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.3" fill="#CE1126"/></svg></span><div><span class="leaknum">Leak 04</span><h3>Clarity</h3><p>Too many choices, so buyers make none. A confused mind always says no.</p></div></div>
      <div class="leak reveal"><span class="icon-badge"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6 6.6.9-4.8 4.6 1.2 6.5L12 17.3l-5.9 3.2 1.2-6.5-4.8-4.6 6.6-.9L12 2.5z" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><div><span class="leaknum">Leak 05</span><h3>Proof</h3><p>Your single best selling tool is buried. Real reviews exist — and the site shows almost none of them.</p></div></div>
      <div class="leak reveal d1"><span class="icon-badge"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 10v4h3l6 4V6L6 10H3z" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 9c1 1 1 5 0 6M19 7c2 2.5 2 7.5 0 10" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><div><span class="leaknum">Leak 06</span><h3>Ad quality</h3><p>Your ads are a hidden mess you're paying for — thin, unbranded, run off a page nobody trusts.</p></div></div>
      <div class="leak reveal d2"><span class="icon-badge"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12h13M12 6l5 6-5 6" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 6h4M4 18h4" stroke="#CE1126" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".4"/></svg></span><div><span class="leaknum">Leak 07</span><h3>Sequence</h3><p>You advertised before the site could hold it. The faster the ad runs, the faster the money drains out.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AUTOMATION DEMO — the follow-up leak, shown as a real conversation instead of just described -->
<section class="automation">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="auto-grid">
      <div class="auto-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Leak 2 · Capture, fixed</span>
        <h2 class="reveal d1">This is what "instant" actually looks like</h2>
        <p class="reveal d2">When someone fills out a form on your site at 9pm, they're not thinking about your business hours. They're thinking about the next store's website.</p>
        <p class="reveal d2"><b>So the reply doesn't wait for Monday.</b> It's automatic, it's in your voice, and it asks a real question — not "thanks for reaching out."</p>
        <ul class="reveal d3">
          <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="#CE1126"/><path d="M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Text and email, both instant, both in your voice</li>
          <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="#CE1126"/><path d="M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>A real next step — book a wet test, not a generic "we'll be in touch"</li>
          <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="#CE1126"/><path d="M7 12.5l3.2 3.2L17 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Runs at 2pm or 2am — the buyer never knows the difference</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="phone reveal d3" id="phoneDemo">
        <div class="phone-screen">
          <div class="phone-head">Your Store · Follow-Up</div>
          <div class="bub bub-in b1">Hi, saw the Aria model online — is it still in stock?</div>
          <div class="bub-time left tm1">9:14 PM</div>
          <div class="typing t2"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="bub bub-out b2">Yes — the Aria's on the floor now. Want to grab a wet test this week? I've got Thurs 4pm or Sat 11am open.</div>
          <div class="bub-time tm2">9:14 PM</div>
          <div class="bub bub-in b3">Sat 11 works</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ONE STORE PER MARKET -->
<section class="market grain seam-top" id="market">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow on-ink reveal">Exclusivity</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">One store per market. By application.</h2>
    <p class="lede reveal d2">We take one hot tub store per market and make it the obvious choice in its city. That means most applications get a no — scarcity is the product, not a promotion.</p>
    <div class="mapband reveal d3">
      <div class="usdots">
        <!-- Contiguous-US silhouette. Every vertex is a real coastline/border point
